{"ok":"// Bit Crush  [audioEffect] — bit reduction, and the one effect of the nine that jsdsp cannot
// express at all: quantising needs a rounding step, and this graph vocabulary has no round and no divide.
// So it is the ENGINE's own — AirWindows De Rez, which reduces both the word length (Rez) and the sample rate
// (Rate). Both are 1 here, meaning untouched; a chain lowers them.
extends("@engine/de-rez-edited1")
params({ Rez: 1, Rate: 1 })
// Word-length and sample-rate reduction. Rez is resolution — 1 is the file's own, 0 destroys it — and Rate is the sample clock, same direction. A span from 16 bits to 2 is roughly Rez 1 down to Rez 0.15; there is no one-knob version because the engine's plugin has no such input.
"}

